Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Rule30FrozenRuler and Rule30EdgeStaircases

Rule30FrozenRuler: every finite nonzero row's right edge is the single cell's
ruler, cut off at one depth (frozen_ruler, no_width_at_depth, depth_dichotomy,
edge_evol, edge_run_alternates).

Rule30EdgeStaircases: staircases near the single cell's right edge end within
2^(W+1) rows (staircase_ends, staircase_ends_pow, front_step); the edge codes
with T (T c) = c are exactly -1/3 and 1/3, and the rain rows (01)^n keep an
eternal staircase (period_two_iff, no_fixed_point, rain_row_eternal).

Contributed by Gareth Herbert with Claude (Anthropic) and GPT (OpenAI).
